2 CONT Husband of: Cheong Soh Chin
2 CONT He has two children with Cheong Soh Chin: Wee Boo Kuan (born 1966), Wee Boo Tee (born 1968)
2 CONT
2 CONT Mr Wee Boo Kuan is a businessman with more
2 CONT than 30 years of experience in the field of Health and Wellness. He has a strong interest and experience in ecological Lifestyles of Health and Sustainability initiatives (LOHAS). He was instrumental in establishing Singapore’s fi
2 CONC rst certified organic farms under Biological Farmers of Australia (BFA) in the late 1990s and was involved in the wholesale and retail of organic products (Brown Rice Paradise) in Singapore, Malaysia, Taiwan and Australia. He init
2 CONC iated the development of a range of Australian certified organic personal care line and obtained organic certification for a hotel in Western Australia.
2 CONT
2 CONT In commemorating his father Wee Cho Bian’s 25th year of passing, Mr Wee decided to co-found Extra•Ordinary People. In close collaboration with the business community and other charities, Extra•Ordinary People will focus on the spe
2 CONC cial needs community in Singapore, contributing to a more inclusive and vibrant community.
2 CONT
