2 CONT Koh Tengah :  was the wife of Chia Yee Soh their children were named Phyllis, Mary, Charlie, Nellie, Robert, Alice, Elsie, Winnie, Ronnie, Harold, and Lionel.    Winnie & Lionel were adopted by Dr. Lee Choon Neo (Singapore's first
2 CONC  lady Physician) & Teo Koon Lim and took the surname Teo.
2 CONT
2 CONT I have note which show the 3 wives of CHIA Yee Soh as 1) Seow Guat Eng who begat Charlie, 2) LAM Loke Yin, 3) CHIA Guat Goh - begat Eric, Olive, Pearly, Irene and Eunice. The chidlren of the 3rd wife are descendants of ONG Ewe Hai
2 CONC  via their mother. I am in contact with Eunice here in Sydney.
2 CONT
2 CONT
