2 CONT The marriage of Mr See Teong Quee, youngest son of the late Mr See Ewe Boon, and brother of Mr See Teong Wah, JP comprador, of the Hongkong and Shanghai Banking Corporation, Singapore Miss Yeo Teow Kim, youngest daughter of Mr and
