1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Mr. Kho Keng Chuan was born in Malacca and later educated in Raffles Institution. He first worked in Adams, Gilfillan and Co. Ltd. Then he became a salesman in the early 1890's to Mr. Arthur Barker before eventuall
2 CONC y becoming his partner in Messrs. Barker and Keng Chuan for 23 years.  The office was located in Change Alley. Kho Keng Chuan is also a member of the Straits Chinese British Association.
