2 CONT
2 CONT Yeo Yam Neo (Mrs Tan Soo Bin) Born 3 November, 1896, Yeo Yam Neo passed away on 23 December 1944. Yeo Yam Neo married Tan Soo Bin (the second son of Tan Jiak Kim).  In a Strait's Times article dated May 11, 1936, Mrs. Tan Soo Bin 
2 CONC was identified as the first Singapore Chinese woman to fly from Europe (she flew from Amsterdam with the K.L.M ).
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.geni.com/threads/6000000105763636877
