2 CONT
2 CONT I am contacting you about this profile: https://www.geni.com/people/Wife-2-Nancy-YEO-Yam-Neo/60000000248313...
2 CONT
2 CONT In burial register, the year of her death was on 23 Dec 1943. Not 1944.
2 CONT
2 CONT Sincerely,
2 CONT
2 CONT E H Khoo Wife 2: Nancy YEO Yam Neo
