1 NOTE {geni:about_me} As for Tan Soo Bin’s children, his youngest son Tan Eng Ann would died during the occupation years in Oct 15 1943 after a short illness . He was born of the second wife Helen Yeo Yam Neo, a daughter of Yeo Poon Sen
2 CONC g. Yam Neo herself died shortly there after in Dec 23 1943 at the age of 50. Yam Neo ‘s daughter Rosalind Tan Hoe Neo passed away on Apr 29, 1941 at Melbourne, a few months after going there to study infant welfare work. Tan Peng 
2 CONC Neo has adopted Hoe Neo as a daughter as well.
2 CONT
