1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Elsie Tan Kim Neo (1905-1939) studied in Raffles Girls School and is the daughter of Mr. and Mrs. Tan Kwee Wah, niece of Tan Boo Liat, grand-daughter of Tan Soon Toh, great granddaughter of Tan Kim Ching and great 
2 CONC great grand daughter of Tan Tock Seng. (source: Geni.com).  The marriage was announced between Miss Elsie Tan ( daughter of Mr and Mrs Tan Kwee Wah of Singapore) to Mr. Edward Chia (eldest son of Mr and Mrs Chia Lip Choon of 8 Pin
2 CONC angsia, Batavia) at the Burgelijkestand Court of Batavia on 16th April 1924. Elsie Tan passed away on 25th August 1939 at the age of  34. From the burial registrar i found out that an yet unnamed infant boy is buried together with
2 CONC  Elsie. This is a tomb of a mother and her son (maybe died during child birth ). Listed on the tomb are the names of her sons; Chales / Charles Chia, Henry Chia, Frank Chia, Lewis Chia and daughters; Katharine Chia, Dorothy Chia, 
2 CONC Angeline Chia, Annette Chia and Margaret Chia. The tomb is at Hill 4 Section C, plot 1371. https://mymindisrojak.blogspot.com/2017/06/elsie-tan-kim-neo-and-family-bukit-brown.html
2 CONT
