2 CONT Lim Peng Siang (Chinese: 林秉祥; pinyin: Lín Bǐngxíang; also known as Lin Bengxian; 1872–1944) was a businessperson in Singapore and Malaya. Together with his brother Lim Peng Mao (Lin Bingmao), he founded the Ho Hong Group of compan
2 CONC ies in 1904, which had interests in banking, shipping, parboiled rice, oil mills, cement, coconut and other businesses
