2 CONT Storekeeper of East Asiatic Co. Ltd. / 1955 beer case
2 CONT https://eresources.nlb.gov.sg/newspapers/digitised/article/singstandard19561107-1.2.48?qt=poh,%20whatt,%20chye&q=poh%20whatt%20chye
