2 CONT  YEO Cheow Ghee Adopted
2 CONT  YEO Cheow Sow Adopted
2 CONT  YEO Cheow Bok b: 1855 in Singapore (biological son)
2 CONT  YEO Bee Har Neo
2 CONT
