1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Oei (Wee) Leong Tan - '''Kapitan China of Bengkalis and Singapore'''
2 CONT
2 CONT http://eresources.nlb.gov.sg/newspapers/Digitised/Article/straitstimes19140728-1.2.60?ST=1&AT=search&k=wee+kee+ann&P=2&Display=0&filterS=0&QT=wee,kee,ann&oref=article
