2 CONT
2 CONT https://overseaschineseinthebritishempire.blogspot.com/2009/10/chinese-kapitans.html
2 CONT
2 CONT https://eresources.nlb.gov.sg/newspapers/Digitised/Article/straitstimes19230702-1.2.42?ST=1&AT=search&k=Fernandez%20Poey&QT=fernandez,poey&oref=article
