1 NOTE {geni:about_me} DEATH - On July 13, 1924 at 27-5 Killiney Road, Singapore, Siow Cheng Watt, ages 75 years, leaving his widow, four sons, Siow Siew San, Siow Siew Keng, Siow Siew Guan and Siow Siew Kim, 4 daughters, 31 grandchildre
2 CONC n and 16 great grandchildren,. Funeral at 10 am on Sunday, July 20, for interment at Bukit Brown Cemetery 
2 CONT
2 CONT GRAND SONS: SIOW PEK CHIANG, SIOW PEK LIANG, SIOW PEK CHWEE, SIOW PEK LEONG, SIOW PEK CHEOK, SIOW PEK YAN, SIOW SIANG YEW, SIOW PEK SWEE, SIOW PEK LENG, SIOW PEK HOE, SIOW PEK GAM, SIOW SIA HOO. 
2 CONT
