2 CONT Name: Mary LEE Cheng Neo  •Sex: F  •Birth: 12 MAY 1897  •Death: 27 JUN 1989  •Note:  Mary Lee was engaged to Tjong Coon Whie, son of Tjong Eng Hean, Mayor of Bali and a well known millionaire in Deli. (Medan was also called Deli i
2 CONC n the past). This makes me wonder whether there is any relation to Tjong A Fie / Tjong Yiauw Hian or his brother Tjong Yong Hian of Medan. Tjong A Fie was the Kapitan Cina of Medan in 1911 after his brother, Tjong Yong Hian passed
2 CONC  away.
2 CONT
2 CONT In another article dated 1913 (one year after Mary's engagement) it mentions a Mrs Tjong Coon Whie (i am assuming Mary Lee), but what is more interesting is that it mentions Mr Tjong Coon Whie father as deceased and with a differe
2 CONC nt spelling variant (Tjong Yoong Hean) and was the former Mayor of Deli which makes me more suspicious about the Medan connection.
2 CONT
