1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Youngest daughter / Dr. Loh Pooh Lip's sister
2 CONT
2 CONT When Great aunt Seok Neo eloped with Cyril Tan Teck Bee.  Aged sixteen, she fibbed about her age to get round needing her guardian's ( her older half brother ) approval to marry Cyril.  She had used her sister's birth certificate 
2 CONC "to prove" her age.
2 CONT
2 CONT In the end, because they were so young, my grandfather (her guardian) welcomed them into his home.  
2 CONT
2 CONT In her old age, she forgot to fess up about the age lie.  She would claim her sister's birth year as hers.  
2 CONT
