2 CONT
2 CONT Mrs Gaw Boon Chan nee Tan Eng Neo 
2 CONT 吳門陳貞潔
2 CONT
2 CONT The Straits Times, 28 December 1941, Pg 7
2 CONT Mrs Gaw Boon Chan (nee Madam Tan Eng Neo) passed away peacefully, aged 81, at her residence No 23 Newton Road, Singapore on 27 Dec 1941
2 CONT
