2 DATE 11 NOV 1899
1 DEAT
2 DATE DEC 1939
2 PLAC General Hospital
2 ADDR
1 OCCU Doctor
1 TITL Dr
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Dr LIM Eng Hae J.P. - Graduated from Hong Kong University 1922 / Royal London Ophthalmic Hospital / started Singapore practice in 1927'''
2 CONT
2 CONT Dr. Lim Eng Hae married Miss Helena Lauw, eldest daughter of Lauw Tjeng Kit,(a well known tea and rubber merchant in Java. Helena Lauw was herself educated in Holland and America.
2 CONT They had 6 children, 4 sons (Lim Ewe Cheang, Lim Ewe Huat, Lim Ewe Hin, Lim Ewe Yang) and 2 daughters (Lim Keow Sian, Lim Keow Cheng). First born in London, Second in Java and 3rd in Penang. The rest were born in Singapore.
2 CONT
2 CONT Mrs Helen Lim Eng Hae passed away on Oct. 31st 1978. She leaves behind her daughters: Elsie Quahe and Cynthia Tchou, sons: Lim Ewe Cheang, Lim Ewe Huat, Lim Ewe Hin, Lim Ewe Yang;  Son-In-Law: Beng Chuan and Peter, and Daughters-i
2 CONC n-Law: Marilyn, Evelyn, Phee Hong and Lily, and grandson-in-law Graham and 11 grandchildren.
2 CONT
