1 OCCU Farming and Agricultural
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Tan Djoe See was born in the year of 1840 at Tjiampea where the Tjisadane river flowed to Tangerang. He migrated to Soekaboemi and he became the founder of the private company "Farming and agricultural"
2 CONT When he was 47 years old he married with Tjio Som Nio from Buitenzorg in the year 1887.
2 CONT In that time Tjio Som Nio's age was 33 years old and she lived in Buitenzorg. By this marriage was born 2 sons and 3 daughters. Tan Djoe See had 16 children with different mothers.
2 CONT
2 CONT Tan Djoe See also has a big house with Chinese characteristic with location at Pintu Hek, Soekaboemi. His house was burnt out by "Gerombolan".
